Package: msearch
Version: 0.4.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libqt5core5a (>= 5.12), libqt5gui5 (>= 5.12), libqt5widgets5 (>= 5.12), libc6
Recommends: libqt5x11extras5
Maintainer: MSearch Contributors <msearch@localhost>
Description: Fast filename search utility for Linux
 MSearch is an Everything-like desktop tool for instant filename search.
 It builds a local index, supports wildcards/filters, tray and hotkeys.
 Homepage: https://github.com/manxisuo/msearch
